":"FedEx Shrugged Off Rising Fuel Costs. Then Guidance Rattled the Stock.","src":"Barron's","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE5wTHYwbXdaYmEyMkU3U0NHMElJTjJTOXVOdGhpczZyam1fc0JwTjloUDNFUjFkdEJVNUo0emk0MUMtTXp5THl0UE1mekJvbWNlaWkwS192Q09HbDNlelFEMWgxVEVTTHpDR0twTFRVQzlSLXJCV0h3?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"聯邦快遞擺脫了燃料成本上漲的影響。然後指導令股票感到不安。"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"電動車","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-07-20","period":"2026-05-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1048911/000104891126000105/fdx-20260531.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"FedEx Corporation (\"FedEx\") was incorporated in Delaware on October 2, 1997 to serve as the parent holding company and provide strategic direction to the FedEx portfolio of companies. FedEx provides customers and businesses worldwide with a broad portfolio of transportation, e-commerce, and business services, offering integrated business solutions utilizing its flexible, efficient, and intelligent global network.","zh":"聯邦快遞公司（「聯邦快遞」）於 1997 年 10 月 2 日在特拉華州註冊成立，作為母公司控股公司，為聯邦快遞公司組合提供策略方向。聯邦快遞為全球客戶和企業提供廣泛的運輸、電子商務和商業服務組合，利用其靈活、高效和智慧的全球網路提供整合的商業解決方案。"},{"en":"Effective June 1, 2026, we changed our fiscal year end from May 31 to December 31. As a result, we will report operating results covering the seven-month transition period from June 1, 2026, through December 31, 2026 (the \"Transition Period\"), in a Transition Report on Form 10-K. Following the Transition Period, we will report our operating results on a calendar-year basis, beginning with the fiscal year ending December 31, 2027. Except as otherwise specified, any reference to a year in this Annual Report indicates our fiscal year ended May 31, 2026 or ended May 31 of the year referenced, and comparisons are to the corresponding period of the prior year.","zh":"自 2026 年 6 月 1 日起，我们将会计年度结束日期从 5 月 31 日更改为 12 月 31 日。因此，我們將在 10-K 表格過渡報告中報告 2026 年 6 月 1 日至 2026 年 12 月 31 日的七個月過渡期（「過渡期」）的營運表現。过渡期结束后，我们将按日历年报告我们的经营业绩，从截至 2027 年 12 月 31 日的财政年度开始。除非另有說明，本年度報告中任何提及年份均指我們截至 2026 年 5 月 31 日或截至所引用年份 5 月 31 日的財政年度，並與上一年同期進行比較。"},{"en":"In December 2024, we announced that FedEx's Board of Directors decided to pursue a full separation of FedEx's less-than-truckload freight transportation services business conducted through FedEx Freight, Inc. (\"FedEx Freight\"). The FedEx Freight business also included FedEx Custom Critical, Inc. (\"FedEx Custom Critical\"), LTL Select, and other operations historically included within our FedEx Freight reporting segment. On May 13, 2026, the FedEx Board of Directors declared a pro rata dividend of 80.1% of the outstanding shares of common stock of FedEx Freight Holding Company, Inc. (\"FedEx Freight Holding\") to FedEx's stockholders of record as of the close of business on May 15, 2026 (the \"Record Date\") to achieve the separation (the \"Spin-Off\"). On June 1, 2026, FedEx stockholders received one share of FedEx Freight common stock for every two shares of FedEx common stock held as of the R","zh":"2024 年 12 月，我們宣布聯邦快遞董事會決定全面剝離聯邦快遞透過 FedEx Freight, Inc.（「FedEx Freight」）所進行的零擔貨運服務業務。 FedEx Freight 業務還包括 FedEx Custom Critical, Inc.（「FedEx Custom Critical」）、LTL Select 以及歷史上包含在 FedEx Freight 報告部門中的其他業務。 2026 年 5 月 13 日，聯邦快遞董事會宣布向截至 2026 年 5 月 15 日收盤時（「記錄日」）登記在冊的聯邦快遞股東按比例派發聯邦快遞貨運控股公司（「聯邦快遞貨運控股」）已發行普通股 80.1% 的股息，以實現分拆（分拆」分拆（分拆。 2026 年 6 月 1 日，联邦快递股东自 R 起每持有 2 股联邦快递普通股即可获得一股联邦快递货运普通股。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"Fed Ex Freight & Fed Ex Express Segments","val":91068000000,"zh":"聯邦快遞貨運和聯邦快遞快遞部門"},{"name":"Federal Express","val":82273000000,"zh":"聯邦快遞部門"},{"name":"Fedex Freight","val":8795000000,"zh":"聯邦快遞貨運部門"}],"total":94720000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-05-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":67944000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":26776000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":94720000000}},"peers":["UPS","TGT","CAT","COST","MMM"]}}